{"id":"vd-b1-the-allotment","level":"b1","n":22,"title":{"en":"I've Given Up Working at Weekends","vi":"Tôi đã bỏ làm việc cuối tuần"},"summary":"Ba tháng sau, Richard quay lại phòng khám; bác sĩ Osei hỏi ông đã thay đổi những thói quen gì.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-b1-the-allotment","level":"b1","title":{"en":"The Allotment","vi":"Mảnh vườn thuê"}},"scene":{"background":"hospital","props":[]},"cast":{"osei":{"name":{"en":"Dr. Osei","vi":"Bác sĩ Osei"},"look":"woman","x":540,"style":{"hair":"bun","hairColor":"#1A1A1A","skin":"#7A4A2E","skinShade":"#643A22","glasses":true,"outfit":"patient","top":"#FFFFFF","topShade":"#E6E6E6"}},"richard":{"name":{"en":"Richard","vi":"Richard"},"look":"man","x":1140,"style":{"hair":"part","hairColor":"#8C8C8C","outfit":"shirt","top":"#5E7D4E","topShade":"#4D683F"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"osei","en":"Good morning, Richard. How are you getting on?","vi":"Chào ông Richard. Dạo này ông thế nào?","ipa":["ɡʊd","ˈmɔɹnɪŋ","ˈɹɪtʃɚd","haʊ","ɑɹ","ju","ˈɡɛtɪŋ","ɑn"],"start":0.554,"end":3.704,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,0.671],[2,1.361],[3,2.744],[4,2.926],[5,3.017],[6,3.121],[7,3.369]]},{"speaker":"richard","en":"Much better, thank you. I feel like a different person.","vi":"Khá hơn nhiều, cảm ơn bác sĩ. Tôi thấy mình như một người khác.","ipa":["mʌtʃ","ˈbɛtɚ","θæŋk","ju","aɪ","fil","laɪk","ə","ˈdɪfɚənt","ˈpɝsən"],"start":4.494,"end":8.354,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,4.494],[1,4.732],[2,5.344],[3,5.617],[4,6.765],[5,6.96],[6,7.221],[7,7.429],[8,7.52],[9,7.885]]},{"speaker":"osei","en":"Your blood pressure has come down a lot. What have you changed?","vi":"Huyết áp của ông giảm nhiều rồi. Ông đã thay đổi những gì?","ipa":["jɔɹ","blʌd","ˈpɹɛʃɚ","hæz","kʌm","daʊn","ə","lɑt","wʌt","hæv","ju","tʃeɪndʒd"],"start":9.144,"end":12.904,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,9.144],[1,9.287],[2,9.561],[3,9.952],[4,10.121],[5,10.342],[6,10.537],[7,10.59],[8,11.933],[9,12.102],[10,12.18],[11,12.297]]},{"speaker":"richard","en":"Well, I've started walking to work. It takes forty minutes.","vi":"À, tôi đã bắt đầu đi bộ đi làm. Mất bốn mươi phút.","ipa":["wɛl","aɪv","ˈstɑɹtɪd","ˈwɔkɪŋ","tu","wɝk","ɪt","teɪks","ˈfɔɹti","ˈmɪnəts"],"start":13.694,"end":17.964,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,13.694],[1,14.149],[2,14.266],[3,14.683],[4,15.06],[5,15.178],[6,16.495],[7,16.755],[8,17.107],[9,17.484]]},{"speaker":"osei","en":"Excellent. And what about your diet?","vi":"Tuyệt vời. Còn chế độ ăn thì sao?","ipa":["ˈɛksələnt","ənd","wʌt","əˈbaʊt","jɔɹ","ˈdaɪət"],"start":18.754,"end":21.464,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,18.754],[1,20.287],[2,20.469],[3,20.612],[4,20.847],[5,20.977]]},{"speaker":"richard","en":"I used to eat at my desk every day, but now I have lunch in the park.","vi":"Trước đây ngày nào tôi cũng ăn ở bàn làm việc, nhưng giờ tôi ăn trưa ở công viên.","ipa":["aɪ","just","tu","it","æt","maɪ","dɛsk","ˈɛvɚi","deɪ","bʌt","naʊ","aɪ","hæv","lʌntʃ","ɪn","ðə","pɑɹk"],"start":22.254,"end":25.794,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,22.254],[1,22.285],[2,22.52],[3,22.624],[4,22.832],[5,22.936],[6,23.067],[7,23.444],[8,23.692],[9,24.238],[10,24.408],[11,24.603],[12,24.694],[13,24.89],[14,25.202],[15,25.306],[16,25.423]]},{"speaker":"osei","en":"That's a good habit. Have you lost any weight?","vi":"Đó là một thói quen tốt. Ông có giảm cân không?","ipa":["ðæts","ə","ɡʊd","ˈhæbət","hæv","ju","lɔst","ˈɛni","weɪt"],"start":26.584,"end":29.594,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,26.584],[1,26.79],[2,26.881],[3,27.089],[4,28.432],[5,28.589],[6,28.719],[7,29.057],[8,29.227]]},{"speaker":"richard","en":"Eight kilos. I've given up chocolate biscuits, too. That was hard.","vi":"Tám ký. Tôi cũng bỏ bánh quy sô-cô-la rồi. Khó lắm đấy.","ipa":["eɪt","ˈkiˌloʊz","aɪv","ˈɡɪvən","ʌp","ˈtʃɔklət","ˈbɪskəts","tu","ðæt","wɑz","hɑɹd"],"start":30.384,"end":36.504,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,30.384],[1,30.645],[2,32.248],[3,32.522],[4,32.847],[5,32.977],[6,33.485],[7,34.162],[8,35.477],[9,35.803],[10,36.011]]},{"speaker":"osei","en":"And the gardening?","vi":"Còn việc làm vườn?","ipa":["ənd","ðə","ˈɡɑɹdənɪŋ"],"start":37.294,"end":38.024,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,37.294],[1,37.372],[2,37.477]]},{"speaker":"richard","en":"I go every Saturday and Wednesday evening. Mrs. Patel is teaching me.","vi":"Tôi đi mỗi thứ Bảy và tối thứ Tư. Bà Patel đang dạy tôi.","ipa":["aɪ","ɡoʊ","ˈɛvɚi","ˈsætɚdi","ənd","ˈwɛnzdi","ˈivnɪŋ","ˈmɪsɪz","pəˈtɛl","ɪz","ˈtitʃɪŋ","mi"],"start":38.814,"end":43.674,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,38.814],[1,38.921],[2,39.13],[3,39.403],[4,40.015],[5,40.197],[6,40.64],[7,41.996],[8,42.413],[9,42.856],[10,43.012],[11,43.416]]},{"speaker":"osei","en":"Do you still answer emails at midnight?","vi":"Ông vẫn trả lời email lúc nửa đêm chứ?","ipa":["du","ju","stɪl","ˈænsɚ","iˈmeɪlz","æt","ˈmɪdˌnaɪt"],"start":44.464,"end":46.344,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,44.464],[1,44.493],[2,44.623],[3,44.962],[4,45.301],[5,45.769],[6,45.847]]},{"speaker":"richard","en":"No. I no longer check my phone after nine. I'm trying to switch off completely at weekends.","vi":"Không. Tôi không còn xem điện thoại sau chín giờ tối nữa. Tôi đang cố hoàn toàn nghỉ ngơi vào cuối tuần.","ipa":["noʊ","aɪ","noʊ","ˈlɔŋɡɚ","tʃɛk","maɪ","foʊn","ˈæftɚ","naɪn","aɪm","ˈtɹaɪɪŋ","tu","swɪtʃ","ɔf","kəmˈplitli","æt","ˈwiˌkɛndz"],"start":47.134,"end":54.124,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,47.134],[1,48.542],[2,48.711],[3,48.88],[4,49.232],[5,49.518],[6,49.674],[7,50],[8,50.273],[9,51.575],[10,51.797],[11,52.083],[12,52.187],[13,52.552],[14,52.773],[15,53.398],[16,53.516]]},{"speaker":"osei","en":"Is that difficult for you?","vi":"Việc đó có khó với ông không?","ipa":["ɪz","ðæt","ˈdɪfəkəlt","fɔɹ","ju"],"start":54.914,"end":56.114,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,54.914],[1,55.031],[2,55.253],[3,55.682],[4,55.878]]},{"speaker":"richard","en":"At first it was terrible. Now it's the best part of my week.","vi":"Lúc đầu thì kinh khủng. Giờ nó là phần tuyệt nhất trong tuần của tôi.","ipa":["æt","fɝst","ɪt","wɑz","ˈtɛɹəbəl","naʊ","ɪts","ðə","bɛst","pɑɹt","ʌv","maɪ","wik"],"start":56.904,"end":61.284,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,56.904],[1,57.05],[2,57.493],[3,57.636],[4,57.858],[5,59.357],[6,59.683],[7,59.878],[8,60.008],[9,60.347],[10,60.581],[11,60.685],[12,60.855]]},{"speaker":"osei","en":"How are you sleeping?","vi":"Giấc ngủ của ông thế nào?","ipa":["haʊ","ɑɹ","ju","ˈslipɪŋ"],"start":62.074,"end":62.894,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,62.074],[1,62.165],[2,62.257],[3,62.361]]},{"speaker":"richard","en":"Seven hours a night. I used to sleep for five, if I was lucky.","vi":"Bảy tiếng mỗi đêm. Trước đây tôi ngủ được năm tiếng, nếu may mắn.","ipa":["ˈsɛvən","ˈaʊɚz","ə","naɪt","aɪ","just","tu","slip","fɔɹ","faɪv","ɪf","aɪ","wɑz","ˈlʌki"],"start":63.684,"end":68.264,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,63.684],[1,64.097],[2,64.462],[3,64.527],[4,65.857],[5,66.026],[6,66.273],[7,66.378],[8,66.664],[9,66.846],[10,67.419],[11,67.563],[12,67.654],[13,67.862]]},{"speaker":"osei","en":"Your stress levels are much lower. The prescription is working.","vi":"Mức độ căng thẳng của ông đã thấp hơn nhiều. Đơn thuốc đang có tác dụng.","ipa":["jɔɹ","stɹɛs","ˈlɛvəlz","ɑɹ","mʌtʃ","ˈloʊɚ","ðə","pɹəˈskɹɪpʃən","ɪz","ˈwɝkɪŋ"],"start":69.054,"end":73.114,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,69.054],[1,69.207],[2,69.598],[3,69.989],[4,70.106],[5,70.366],[6,71.788],[7,71.931],[8,72.491],[9,72.621]]},{"speaker":"richard","en":"Thank you, Doctor. I'll bring you some tomatoes in September.","vi":"Cảm ơn bác sĩ. Tháng Chín tôi sẽ mang cà chua đến biếu bà.","ipa":["θæŋk","ju","ˈdɑktɚ","aɪl","bɹɪŋ","ju","sʌm","təˈmeɪtoʊz","ɪn","sɛpˈtɛmbɚ"],"start":73.904,"end":78.174,"expression":"happy","react":{"osei":"happy"},"timing":[[0,73.904],[1,74.134],[2,74.55],[3,75.985],[4,76.206],[5,76.453],[6,76.584],[7,76.818],[8,77.378],[9,77.521]]}],"words":[{"id":"habit","en":"habit","ipa":"ˈhæbət","vi":"thói quen","level":0},{"id":"stress","en":"stress","ipa":"stɹɛs","vi":"sự căng thẳng; áp lực; n